note Converted from the Lapis prototype, attic/lapis/charts.lp.
note
note Lapis wrote `command show chart (type) with (data)`. The Shark form
note `to show chart a kind with the data` keeps the same two-word start, which
note the registry accepts beside `show text` and `show button`. Phrasing it as
note `to show a chart ...` instead would be rejected with E-0312, because the
note start would be just `show`.
note
note Shark's core has no chart or progress-bar picture yet, so for now these
note show their values as text. When a drawing library arrives only the bodies
note change; every line that says `show chart ...` keeps working as written.

share show chart
share show progress

note doc Renders a visual interactive chart.
to show chart a kind with the data
  show text value of kind chart of value of data

note doc Renders an animated progress bar.
to show progress the percent as a whole number
  show text value of percent percent complete
